Konvu Telemetry uses a bundled snapshot of LiteLLM's public model-price table
with provider-published overrides for models newer than the pinned snapshot.

LiteLLM pricing data: https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm
LiteLLM is distributed under the MIT License: https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm/blob/main/LICENSE

The bundled snapshot is `src/konvu_telemetry/pricing.json`.
SHA-256: 86f7c8fe22727b76d6f8646a77f44875d0c3cdeaa5bcbeb1977cc5a30c5ba7b6
It is local estimate data, not a provider billing ledger.

Konvu Telemetry depends on pinned releases of OpenAI's tiktoken and Sander Land's ctok for local context-token estimates. Both are distributed under the MIT License.

tiktoken: https://github.com/openai/tiktoken
ctok: https://github.com/sanderland/ctok
